    "Statement of Purpose": "宗旨声明",
    "No. KCTS/2027/A": "编号 KCTS/2027/A",
    "Why this summit exists": "本峰会举办缘由",
    "Kenya grows more tea than almost anyone. It earns less from it than it should. This is a three-day attempt to change that in one specific direction.": "肯尼亚的茶叶产量位居世界前列。但其茶叶收益却未达应有水平。本峰会为期三天,旨在朝特定方向改变这一现状。",
    "The Kenya-China Tea Summit is a landmark international platform designed to deepen trade, investment, innovation and cultural cooperation between Kenya and China within the tea value chain. It runs in Nairobi from 21–23 April 2027.": "肯尼亚-中国茶叶峰会是一个里程碑式的国际平台,旨在深化肯尼亚与中国在茶叶价值链内的贸易、投资、创新和文化合作。峰会将于2027年4月21日至23日在内罗毕举行。",
    "The problem it is convened around": "峰会召开所针对的问题",
    "Kenya is one of the world's largest tea exporters by volume. It is not one of the largest earners. The tea leaves the country in bulk, is blended and branded somewhere else, and the margin is captured somewhere else too. Analysts have put it plainly: Kenya exports more tea than China and Sri Lanka, and earns less for it, held back by bulk sales, a narrow product range and limited market diversity.": "肯尼亚是世界上按出口量计算最大的茶叶出口国之一,但并非收入最高的国家之一。茶叶以散装形式离开该国,在其他地方进行拼配和品牌包装,利润也在其他地方获取。分析人士直言不讳地指出:肯尼亚的茶叶出口量超过中国和斯里兰卡,但收入却更少,受制于散装销售、产品种类单一和市场多样性有限。",
    "Ecofin Agency, 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-agriculture/0107-47500-kenya-leads-in-tea-exports-but-trails-in-revenues-compared-to-china-and-sri-lanka\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya leads in tea exports but trails in revenues</a>": "Ecofin Agency, 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-agriculture/0107-47500-kenya-leads-in-tea-exports-but-trails-in-revenues-compared-to-china-and-sri-lanka\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚茶叶出口量领先但收入落后于中国和斯里兰卡</a>",
    "China is where that gap is sharpest, and where it is moving fastest in the wrong direction. Kenyan tea exports to China fell 51% in the first quarter of 2026, to 1.22 million kilogrammes.": "中国是这一差距最为明显的地方,而且正在以最快的速度朝着错误的方向发展。2026年第一季度,肯尼亚对中国的茶叶出口下降了51%,降至122万公斤。",
    "The Kenyan Wall Street, Q1 2026 — <a href=\"https://kenyanwallstreet.com/tea-exports-q1-2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya tea exports: Sudan ban and Pakistan's Q1 rise</a>": "The Kenyan Wall Street, Q1 2026 — <a href=\"https://kenyanwallstreet.com/tea-exports-q1-2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚茶叶出口:苏丹禁令和巴基斯坦第一季度的增长</a>",
    "That decline sits against a national policy pointing the other way. Kenya is targeting close to 200 million kilogrammes of green and orthodox tea by 2030 — a deliberate move away from bulk black — and China has a zero-tariff door open. The Tea Board of Kenya has been working with Chinese partners on processing machinery, energy-efficient technology and, reportedly, an online auction platform.": "这种下降与指向相反方向的国家政策形成对比。肯尼亚的目标是到2030年生产接近2亿公斤的绿茶和工夫茶——这是有意识地摆脱散装红茶的举措——而中国已经敞开了零关税的大门。肯尼亚茶叶局一直在与中国合作伙伴合作开发加工机械、节能技术,据报道还包括一个在线拍卖平台。",
    "China Daily, 21 July 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/21/WS6a5ec8f3a310986e2b466594.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya targets bigger tea exports to Chinese market</a>": "China Daily, 21 July 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/21/WS6a5ec8f3a310986e2b466594.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚瞄准扩大对中国市场的茶叶出口</a>",
    "A note on the figures above": "关于上述数据的说明",
    "Every number on this page comes from published trade reporting, is dated, and links to its source. None of it is a claim by the summit or a forecast of what the summit will achieve. It is the context the summit was called in response to.": "本页面上的每一个数字都来自已发布的贸易报告,标注了日期,并链接到其来源。这些都不是峰会的主张,也不是对峰会将取得成果的预测。这是峰会召开所回应的背景。",
    "What it is trying to do": "峰会试图实现的目标",
    "Six objectives, as set by the secretariat.": "秘书处制定的六项目标。",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Strengthen trade relations</h3>\n      <p>Build durable commercial links between Kenyan tea producers and Chinese buyers.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>加强贸易关系</h3>\n      <p>在肯尼亚茶叶生产商与中国买家之间建立持久的商业联系。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Promote investment</h3>\n      <p>Open Kenya&#39;s tea value chain to Chinese capital across processing, packaging and logistics.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>促进投资</h3>\n      <p>向中国资本开放肯尼亚茶叶价值链,涵盖加工、包装和物流各环节。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Support innovation</h3>\n      <p>Bring agricultural technology, processing equipment and traceability tools to the people who will use them.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>支持创新</h3>\n      <p>将农业技术、加工设备和可追溯性工具带给实际使用者。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Facilitate market access</h3>\n      <p>Shorten the route from a Kenyan estate to a Chinese shelf.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>促进市场准入</h3>\n      <p>缩短从肯尼亚茶园到中国货架的路径。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Foster collaboration</h3>\n      <p>Put producers, policymakers, financiers and researchers in the same rooms for three days.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>促进合作</h3>\n      <p>让生产商、政策制定者、金融家和研究人员在同一会场共聚三天。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Promote tea culture</h3>\n      <p>Set Kenya&#39;s tea heritage alongside China&#39;s, as trade and as culture.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>推广茶文化</h3>\n      <p>将肯尼亚的茶叶传统与中国的茶文化并列呈现,既作为贸易也作为文化。</p>\n    </div>",
    "Who it is for": "适合人群",
    "The summit is built around a specific problem: the people who grow and process Kenyan tea and the people who buy it in China rarely occupy the same building. Everyone below is invited because they sit somewhere on that chain.": "本次峰会围绕一个具体问题而设:种植和加工肯尼亚茶叶的人与在中国购买茶叶的人很少处于同一建筑物内。以下所有人士均受邀参会,因为他们都位于该产业链的某个环节。",
