    "This is the first edition. There is no previous year to point at, no archive of past delegates, and no attendance figure to quote. Everything published on this site is either confirmed by the secretariat or sourced and dated. Where something is not yet settled — the venue, the fees, the speakers — the page says so rather than filling the space.": "这是首届峰会。没有往年可供参考,没有过往代表档案,也没有参会人数可引用。本网站发布的所有信息均经秘书处确认或已注明来源和日期。凡尚未确定的事项——场地、费用、演讲嘉宾——页面会如实说明,而非填充内容。",
